<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18407" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφνειός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, also
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Hes.
			<u>Fr.</u>
			134.2
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Pi.
			<u>O.</u>
			7.1
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			A.R.
			1.57
		</span></i>, etc.: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄφενος</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rich, wealthy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.825
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>in</i> a thing, c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφνειὸς βιότοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					5.544
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσοῖό τε ἐσθῆτός τε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					1.165
				</span></i>
			 (
				Comp.
			): c.acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρένας ἀφνειός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					455
				</span></i>
			: c. dat., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἀρούραις, μήλοις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				24.108
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				25.119
			</span></i>; <i>abundant,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					3.648
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάκρυα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					2.156
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀ.,</span> title of Ares in
			Arcadia, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				8.44.7
			</span></i>: irreg. 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antim.
					73
				</span></i>
			: regul. 
				Comp.
			 and 
				Sup.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				20.220
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφνεός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				188
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				559
			</span></i>, and generally in Lyr. and Trag., <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				1.10
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				B.
				1.62
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				3
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				96
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				457
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			). [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱφν</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰφν</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱφνεώτερος</span> in S.l.c.: <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
			</span></i> has <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ</span> in
		ll.cc.]</div>
